\ A relaxed type-check pragma disables output narrowing along with its tag
\ check, so the returned value stays opaque and the following `inspect`
\ keeps its cold interpreter branch. Under the lock that fallback rejects
\ the build.
\
\ Build-only: the golden is the rejection report.
pragma{ type-check: "off" }

answer: ( -- result: fixnum ) [ 42 ] ;

answer inspect print-line
